1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The [https://www.myheritage.no/research/collection-10053/us-foderale-1940-folketelling?itemId=1258725124-&groupId=33e8e1376487a1a9e8b9588f77e42c4c&action=showRecord#fullscreen US 1940 census] shows him and his wife
2 CONC  owning an architect practice in Honolulu.
2 CONT
2 CONT The [http://pcad.lib.washington.edu/person/5174/ PCAD database] shows him as a draftsman with Julia Morgan in San Francisco.
2 CONT
2 CONT The book "Hawaiian Modern: The Architecture of Vladimir Ossipff" says (page 40) that "Bjarne Dahl (1897-1989) came to supervise the construction of Morgan's YWCA, turned down an offer to be a partner in her firm, and remained in t
2 CONC he islands as head architect for the Territorial Public Works Department before forming the firm of Dahl and Conrad in 1935". (page 40)
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:MS3G-KP6 1900 Census] - Chicago, only child. Parents called "Ed C" and "Katcherine".
2 CONT * [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:MKZ5-D6X 1910 Census] - Chicago, parents and 2 sisters. Parents called "Cato M" and "Chaterina".
