1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mechanic, hotel proprietor, restorer of cembalos of worldwide renown, friend.
2 CONT
2 CONT After Pearl Harbor, he lived briefly with family friend [https://stage.geni.com/people/Julia-Morgan/6000000023738521102 Julia Morgan] before moving in with an aunt and uncle in Palo Alto.
2 CONT
2 CONT He met his wife while travelling in Sweden, and stayed there working for a while before they returned to the US.
2 CONT
2 CONT He owned and restored the [http://www.cardinalhotel.com/ Cardinal Hotel] in Palo Alto from 1975 - it was previously owned by his parents, his aunt and his uncle according to [http://www.paloaltoonline.com/news/2007/09/04/old-fashi
2 CONC oned-but-not-outdated Palo Alto Online].
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QV9Z-28RB Passenger list] from a trip Bjarne and Eva made - return to Honolulu from San Francisco, arriving Aug 8 1935
2 CONT * [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:KBRM-H3C 2006 "Public Record"] showing listed addresses.
2 CONT * [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:VQ96-RQ3 2009 Social Security Death Index record]
2 CONT * [http://www.legacy.com/obituaries/mercurynews/obituary.aspx?n=bjarne-dahl-barney&pid=127317772 San Jose Mercury News obituary]
2 CONT * [https://archive.org/stream/Harpsichordv2n1/harpsichordv2n1_djvu.txt Article about a harpsichord] in "The Harpsichord" from 1969
2 CONT * [http://threebeehives.blogspot.se/2014/11/fit-to-be-square.html Account of a 1987 square piano restoration] from the de Büren familly 
