1 NAME Dorte Malena Larsdatter /Grødheim/
2 GIVN Dorte Malena Larsdatter
2 SURN Grødheim
2 _MARNM Haga
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1804
2 PLAC Grødheim
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 2 SEP 1804
2 ADDR
