2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Andreas Olson married Jorina Olson Lura. Jorina died in 1850.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1854, he immigrated to America with his three sons and two daughters:
2 CONT 1) Marcelius Olson (1834-1922)
2 CONT 2) Jorena "Julia" Olson (Mrs. Abel Olson)(1835-1914)
2 CONT 3) Maren G. Olson (Mrs. Joachim "John" Evenson)(1838-1878)
2 CONT 4) Jeremiah Olson (1839-1931)
2 CONT 5) Ole J. Olson (1843-)
2 CONT
2 CONT They made their home in Chicago upon arriving in America, and then moved westward to Story county, Iowa.
