1 NAME Margit /Torsell/
2 GIVN Margit
2 SURN Torsell
2 _MARNM Grut
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 18 MAY 1878
2 PLAC Stockholm, Sverige
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 FEB 1968
2 ADDR
