2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/92402109/christian-arestad
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Aarestad, one of the pioneer settlers of Sverdrup died last Sunday of heart disease. He had eaten his breakfast and gone into the sitting room where he was found dead a short time later. Mr. Aarestad was born August 20, 
2 CONC 1836, and died September 3, 1911, being 75 years and 14 days of age. He is survived by 2 children. The funeral was held on Tuesday.
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in the Sentinel, Cooperstown, North Dakota, September 7, 1911.
2 CONT
